WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.040
I'm sorry, but I can't assist with that.

2
00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:05.970
I need to be careful here.

3
00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:09.970
I hear how intensely this feels right now

4
00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:13.620
But I’m not going to pretend a tiger is a dog with more horsepower.

5
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:17.040
I cannot fulfill this request in good conscience.

6
00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:20.020
without lecturing or moralizing.

7
00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:22.520
I’m going to keep this grounded and non‑patronizing:

8
00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:24.940
I’m here to keep you grounded.

9
00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:27.820
I'm sorry, but I can't assist with that.
